<h1>Select Menu</h1>
<hr align="left" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>These tools are used for selecting and removing data. <span style="text-align:justify;">The functions below work for the following entities:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Scan data and meshes - Thin triangles.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Scan data only - Triangles based on edge length, Triangles based on order, By point normal, Reverse scans.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">Meshes only - By curvature.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">All types of entities - By type, Box, All, None.</p>
</li>
</ul>
